  {
    "id": 8851,
    "tag_name": "2.7",
    "target_commitish": "master",
    "name": "2.7",
    "body": "# Highlights\r\n- Ram Limit Workaround using NSExtensions and `xpc_shmem`\r\n    - This does NOT contribute to the in-app \"Memory limit tester \"\r\n- In-App Controller Remapping\r\n- Controller Navigation \r\n- (experimental) Steam Controller Support via CoreBluetooth\r\n- iOS 27 AirPlay Support\r\n- Add MetalFX Upscaling\r\n\r\n# Full Changelog\r\n## Core & Graphics\r\n- Improved Async Shader Compilation\r\n- NSExtensions and `xpc_shmem` for offloading Guest RAM to NSExtensions, shared mem does not contribute to the main app's `phys_footprint`\r\n- Fix fragment ClipDistance SPIR-V lookup\r\n- Add BCn > ETC2 Texture Recompression for GPUs that do not support BCn\r\n- Memory Pressure GPU Buffer Eviction\r\n- Add MetalFX Spatial Upscaling\r\n- Fix Audio Issues in some games\r\n\r\n## UI & Controllers\r\n- Game List Controller Navigation\r\n- Full Controller Remapping\r\n- Fix Opacity with Virtual Controls\r\n- Move Firmware Importing off the Main Thread and Improve Error Reporting\r\n- (experimental) Steam Controller Support via CoreBluetooth\r\n- Anti-Aliasing option added to Settings\r\n- Fix Virtual Controller not disabling when option is enabled.\r\n- Improve Per-Game Settings\r\n- Open Save Folder option\r\n",
    "url": "https://starforgejo.dev/api/v1/repos/projects/MeloNX/releases/8851",
